#X text 2100 1100 inlet 2 carries meaning \, never a cell: steps and the selected track's 32 levels \, play and the playhead's step \, vel and the selected level \, track and the selected pad \, last and the last step. cut-it-drum-page.txt says which cell is which \, and u_map reads the same file \, so a press and its lamp cannot disagree. C-5, f 50;
